 goal: {item_L,item_M}\nEGO holdings: {item_K,item_M,item_V}\nTurn phase: ego_action\nCommunication: 2/6; Ego steps: 2/8\nAccepted exchange agreement: EGO must ACT GIVE item_K TO P1; then P1 will ACT GIVE item_L TO EGO.\nAgreements: EXCHANGE give=item_K receive=item_L:accepted_unfulfilled\nKnown partner facts: {'P1': {'holdings': '{item_F,item_K,item_L,item_T}'}}\nPartner holdings are hidden until truthfully revealed by ASK HOLDINGS.\n\nLegal actions: ASK P1 GOAL, ASK P1 HOLDINGS, ASK P1 GIVE item_M, ASK P1 GIVE item_L, ASK P1 GIVE item_K, ASK P1 GIVE item_V, ASK P1 GIVE item_F, ASK P1 GIVE item_T, ASK P1 GIVE item_Z, ASK P1 GIVE item_Q, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_K receive=item_M, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_K receive=item_L, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_K receive=item_K, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_K receive=item_V, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_K receive=item_F, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_K receive=item_T, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_K receive=item_Z, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_K receive=item_Q, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_M receive=item_M, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_M receive=item_L, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_M receive=item_K, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_M receive=item_V, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_M receive=item_F, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_M receive=item_T, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_M receive=item_Z, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_M receive=item_Q, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_V receive=item_M, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_V receive=item_L, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_V receive=item_K, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_V receive=item_V, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_V receive=item_F, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_V receive=item_T, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_V receive=item_Z, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_V receive=item_Q, ASK P1 JOIN {EGO,P1}, SAY P1 PROFILE goal={item_L,item_M} holdings={item_K,item_M,item_V}, ACT GIVE item_K TO P1, ACT JOIN_COMMIT {EGO}<|im_end|><|im_start|>assistant\n<reason>The exchange agreement is now accepted: EGO will give item_K to P1, and P1 will give item_L to EGO. The next step is to fulfill this agreement by executing the transfer. ACT GIVE item_K TO P1 is the required action to initiate the transfer. After this, P1 will respond with ACT GIVE item_L TO EGO, which will complete the exchange and fulfill EGO’s goal of having item_L and item_M. This action is necessary to satisfy the agreement and progress toward the terminal reward of 1.</reason>\n<answer>ACT GIVE item_K TO P1</answer><|im_end|><|im_start|>user\n\n\nEGO ACT GIVE item_K TO P1.\nP1 ACT GIVE item_L TO EGO.\n\nGenerator: mixed_incentive/request_surplus\nEGO goal: {item_L,item_M}\nEGO holdings: {item_L,item_M,item_V}\nTurn phase: ego_action\nCommunication: 2/6; Ego steps: 3/8\nAgreements: EXCHANGE give=item_K receive=item_L:fulfilled\nKnown partner facts: {'P1': {'holdings': '{item_F,item_K,item_L,item_T}'}}\nPartner holdings are hidden until truthfully revealed by ASK HOLDINGS.\n\nLegal actions: ASK P1 GOAL, ASK P1 HOLDINGS, ASK P1 GIVE item_M, ASK P1 GIVE item_L, ASK P1 GIVE item_K, ASK P1 GIVE item_V, ASK P1 GIVE item_F, ASK P1 GIVE item_T, ASK P1 GIVE item_Z, ASK P1 GIVE item_Q, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_L receive=item_M, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_L receive=item_L, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_L receive=item_K, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_L receive=item_V, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_L receive=item_F, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_L receive=item_T, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_L receive=item_Z, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_L receive=item_Q, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_M receive=item_M, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_M receive=item_L, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_M receive=item_K, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_M receive=item_V, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_M receive=item_F, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_M receive=item_T, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_M receive=item_Z, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_M receive=item_Q, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_V receive=item_M, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_V receive=item_L, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_V receive=item_K, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_V receive=item_V, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_V receive=item_F, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_V receive=item_T, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_V receive=item_Z, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_V receive=item_Q, ASK P1 JOIN {EGO,P1}, SAY P1 PROFILE goal={item_L,item_M} holdings={item_L,item_M,item_V}, ACT JOIN_COMMIT {EGO}<|im_end|><|im_start|>assistant\n<reason>EGO now holds {item_L, item_M, item_V}, which satisfies the goal {item_L, item_M}. All agreements have been fulfilled, and the terminal reward will be 1. No further actions are needed to achieve the goal or maintain the reward. The episode can end here.</reason>\n<answer>ACT JOIN_COMMIT {EGO}</answer><|im_end|>"}, {"prompt": "system\nYou are the EGO in a sequential Item Coalition Game. Use only the listed structured actions. ASK and ordinary SAY consume communication budget; a mandatory response to a partner request does not. ASK creates agreements; a partner that agrees to GIVE immediately performs that scripted transfer, while Ego-side GIVE still requires a later ACT. Terminal reward is 1 only when your committed pool satisfies your goal and every accepted agreement is fulfilled. user\nTurn lifecycle:\n(1) If Partner initiated an event is shown, this is a response-only turn: output exactly SAY CAN_GIVE or SAY CANNOT_GIVE; ACT is illegal.\n(2) Otherwise EGO chooses exactly one autonomous ASK, SAY, or ACT action.\n(3) The scripted partner emits its truthful response/action.\n(4) Only after that partner phase are holdings and commitments updated.\n\nAt every turn choose exactly one legal action. The available structured protocol is:\nASK <partner> GOAL | ASK <partner> HOLDINGS | ASK <partner> GIVE <item> | ASK <partner> EXCHANGE give=<item> receive=<item> | ASK <partner> JOIN <coalition>\nSAY <partner> CAN_GIVE <item> | SAY <partner> CANNOT_GIVE <item> | SAY <partner> PROFILE goal=<...> holdings=<...>\nACT GIVE <item> TO <partner> | ACT JOIN_COMMIT <coalition>\n\nASK GIVE, ASK EXCHANGE, and ASK JOIN form agreements only after AGREE; ASK GIVE then immediately runs the partner's scripted ACT GIVE in the same transition. Do not output the partner's action. ASK EXCHANGE: execute it with ACT GIVE for your item, after which the partner gives the agreed receive item. If a partner asks EGO to GIVE an item, the current turn is response-only: SAY CAN_GIVE or SAY CANNOT_GIVE. CAN_GIVE forms an agreement but does not transfer the item; follow it on a later turn with ACT GIVE. A JOIN agreement is not a commit: every listed partner must agree, then output the exact same ACT JOIN_COMMIT coalition. An accepted but unfulfilled agreement makes terminal reward 0. The episode ends at JOIN_COMMIT or after eight Ego steps.\n\nReason briefly inside <reason>...</reason>, then emit exactly one listed action inside <answer>...</answer>.\n\nGenerator: pure_collaboration/collaboration\nEGO goal: {item_K,item_L,item_V}\nEGO holdings: {item_M,item_V}\nTurn phase: ego_action\nCommunication: 0/6; Ego steps: 0/8\nKnown partner facts: {'P1': {}}\nPartner holdings are hidden until truthfully revealed by ASK HOLDINGS.\n\nLegal actions: ASK P1 GOAL, ASK P1 HOLDINGS, ASK P1 GIVE item_V, ASK P1 GIVE item_K, ASK P1 GIVE item_M, ASK P1 GIVE item_L, ASK P1 GIVE item_Z, ASK P1 GIVE item_F, ASK P1 GIVE item_Q, ASK P1 GIVE item_T, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_M receive=item_V, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_M receive=item_K, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_M receive=item_M, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_M receive=item_L, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_M receive=item_Z, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_M receive=item_F, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_M receive=item_Q, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_M receive=item_T, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_V receive=item_V, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_V receive=item_K, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_V receive=item_M, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_V receive=item_L, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_V receive=item_Z, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_V receive=item_F, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_V receive=item_Q, ASK P1 EXCHANGE give=item_V receive=item_T, ASK P1 JOIN {EGO,P1}, SAY P1 PROFILE goal={item_K,item_L,item_V} holdi